                {
                    "text": "Mi\u0142o\u015b\u0107 jest dobrym drogowskazem\ud83d\udca5",
                    "author": "@JustynaKrzak-z2x",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-23T22:50:25Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Pi\u0119kna piosenka filmik cudowny przepi\u0119kne s\u0142owa dzi\u0119kuj\u0119 buziaczki dla ciebie scskam\u2764\u2764\ud83d\ude02\u2764\u2764\u2764\ud83e\udec2\ud83e\ude75\ud83e\udec2",
                    "author": "@Irena-7ytv",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-26T20:26:00Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\u2764\ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a, pi\u0119kne przes\u0142anie, \u017cycz\u0105c Tobie mi\u0142ych sn\u00f3w jutro spotkamy si\u0119 zn\u00f3w, Dobranoc, buziaki \ud83d\udc93 na noc \ud83c\udf03 zostawiam, dzi\u0119ki za pi\u0119kn\u0105 piosenk\u0119 \u2764\u2764\u2764\ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a",
                    "author": "@wandakuszel7842",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-23T21:43:50Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u015aliczna \ud83e\udd79\ud83d\udc94\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f\ud83d\ude14",
                    "author": "@barbarapaterkiewicz8440",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-24T04:46:16Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Moje serduszko te\u017c p\u0142onie",
                    "author": "@Mariola-fw4xm",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-24T18:16:19Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25",
                    "author": "@jaroslawkaczmarek599",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-23T20:15:35Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\u2764",
                    "author": "@EwaSobol-g7n",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-24T18:44:18Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f",
                    "author": "@mariolamaleszka5993",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-23T21:34:32Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\ud83d\udc95\ud83d\udc93\ud83d\udc96\u2764\ud83e\uddda\ud83e\uddda\ud83e\uddda\ud83d\udc96\ud83d\udc96\ud83d\udc93\ud83d\udc93\ud83e\udd29\ud83d\udc95\u2764\ud83d\udc9e",
                    "author": "@RobertPerz-d3y",
                    "likes": 2,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-27T14:05:08Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Cze\u015b\u0107 \ud83d\ude0a\nNie wiem, co si\u0119 dzieje we mnie\nCzuje si\u0119 jakbym by\u0142a kim innym\nPustka wsz\u0119dzie nawet w my\u015blach\nJakby nic w \u017cyciu nie by\u0142o, cisza\nS\u0142owa sta\u0142y si\u0119 ci\u0119\u017ckie, obce\nA ja jakbym by\u0142a obserwowa\u0142a\nSiebie z daleka nie rozpoznaj\u0105\nSiebie, to nowy smutek czuje si\u0119\nJakbym si\u0119 \u017cegna\u0142a z czym\u015b czego\nNie znam, nie b\u0119d\u0119 szuka\u0142a\nWyja\u015bnienia po prostu napisa\u0142am\nNie chc\u0119 odej\u015b\u0107, nie zostawiaj\u0105c\nPo sobie \u015bladu, kocha\u0142am ci\u0119\nPrzysz\u0142es bez obietnicy zostaj\u0105c\nBez warunk\u00f3w jakby\u015b by\u0142 jedyn\u0105\nRzecz\u0105, o kt\u00f3r\u0105 nie prosi\u0142am sam\nDo mnie trafi\u0142e\u015b i bez s\u0142owa\nOdeszles \ud83d\ude0a\u2764\u2764pa pa kwiatuszku \ud83d\ude0a",
                    "author": "@mieciaszymkiewicz4618",
                    "likes": 1,
                    "publishedAt": "2026-04-25T09:30:58Z"
                },
                {
                    "text": "\u2764\ud83d\ude22\u2764\ud83d\ude22\u2764",
                    "author": "@SylwiaKostrzewa-e6i",
                    "likes": 1,
